## Not verified
- **Native window run / screenshots**: the Windows desktop was on the lock screen ("Enter your PIN") during the attempt, so the capture showed nothing useful. I deleted the misleading images and left `NOT_VERIFIED.txt` plus the run log in `artifacts/ui/us061/`. The editor did start, run, and close cleanly with code 0 and a saved workspace.
- **`linux-gcc` preset**: local GCC is 9.4 and the CI job needs GCC 11+.
- **Native Linux Vulkan GPU run**: WSL has no Vulkan adapter. The host exits with "no hardware Vulkan adapter".
- **`engine_bench`**: there is no harness yet (US-074), so no benchmark numbers.
